  "description": "After suffering a fever one day, the memories of my past life came back to me. I'm living in the oriental fantasy novel I read in my previous life! I know the story, so I thought there wouldn't be a big problem, until I realized... My brother, my sweet and kind older brother will become the villain of the novel who enjoys blood and slaughter?! But he doesn't look like a villain yet. It's not too late to change the story. I'll protect you, brother! Let's forget that Heavenly Demon stuff and lay down a path of flowers for you!\n\n**Original Novel:**                                                              \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/54259777/)                           \n*Translations: [English](https://webnovel.com/book/the-dragon-prince's-wife-is-a-translator_12611858906139605)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Blice](https://www.blice.co.kr/mw/detail.kt?novelId=92054), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000067594), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H047157604), \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11920009), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H047157604), [RidiBooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4116004035)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://dbook.docomo.ne.jp/item/618ed33ed47ce18d8b28401cee9a5d28824f926ce022bac03f5e8d1d05c1e36d/2000/)",
